1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,320
Blue Ribbon Fried Chicken is easily some of the most devour-worthy fried chicken in New York City.

2
00:00:04,679 --> 00:00:06,179
Let's watch one of their platters get made.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,320
Two thighs, two wings, two breasts, and two drumsticks are fried until they're insanely crispy.

4
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,800
And then the final touch.

5
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:16,640
Each piece gets an aggressive amount of their house seasoning.

6
00:00:18,719 --> 00:00:21,579
Pro tip, ask for their wasabi honey and never look back.

